  "title": "Nu Skin Enterprises Announces Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "PROVO, Utah --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 7, 2026-- Nu Skin Enterprises, Inc. (NYSE: NUS) today announced its board of directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.06 per share, which will be paid on June 10, 2026, to shareholders of record on May 29, 2026. About Nu Skin Enterprises Inc.",
